# OneShot API base URL for LIVE demo runs.
# Leave unset → Demo Console runs in Replay Mode (recorded run, deterministic).
# Set       → Demo Console streams LIVE Sandbox runs (real rejections) from the API.
# With the default dev setup: bun run api → ws://localhost:8787 (VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8787)
VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:8787"
